    "boundary": "若相邻差并不恒定，则首尾配对之和不一定固定。",
    "candidate_id": "hs-semantic-pilot-119-s03",
    "claim": "S_n=n(a_1+a_n)/2=n[2a_1+(n-1)d]/2。",
    "counterexample": "序列1,2,4三项之和为7，首尾公式3(1+4)/2=7.5不正确。",
    "course_track": "SELECTIVE_COMPULSORY",
    "hypotheses": [
