    "boundary": "q=1不能套入分母1-q的表达式；首项为0的情形不要用相邻商定义公比。",
    "candidate_id": "hs-semantic-pilot-119-s05",
    "claim": "q≠1时S_n=a_1(1-q^n)/(1-q)；q=1时S_n=na_1。",
    "counterexample": "q=1、a1=2、n=4，实际和8，而分式给出0/0未定义。",
    "course_track": "SELECTIVE_COMPULSORY",
    "hypotheses": [
